    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1335630/extras/94eba7c09298a7ed7c097372e9cfbf01.poster.avif?t=1728721208\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1335630/extras/94eba7c09298a7ed7c097372e9cfbf01.webm?t=1728721208\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1335630/extras/94eba7c09298a7ed7c097372e9cfbf01.mp4?t=1728721208\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>IMHA is a first-person shooter set on an island ravaged by a demon invasion.</strong> Battle your way through endless hordes of enemies and survive the onslaught of relentless ghouls and demons.<br>Your path will lead you through abandoned villages, dark forests, dangerous swamps and ancient ruins. IMHA is a passion project made with custom engine by a one-man team. This horror-themed FPS features dynamic pacing and spawn system providing unique challenges every time you play.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Fight through endless hordes of deadly enemies.<br></li><li>Survive an apocalyptic invasion of relentless monsters.<br></li><li>Overcome challenging boss encounters.<br></li><li>Experience a dynamic ever-changing world.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1335630/extras/94eba7c09298a7ed7c097372e9cfbf01.poster.avif?t=1728721208\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1335630/extras/94eba7c09298a7ed7c097372e9cfbf01.webm?t=1728721208\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1335630/extras/94eba7c09298a7ed7c097372e9cfbf01.mp4?t=1728721208\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>IMHA is a first-person shooter set on an island ravaged by a demon invasion.</strong> Battle your way through endless hordes of enemies and survive the onslaught of relentless ghouls and demons.<br>Your path will lead you through abandoned villages, dark forests, dangerous swamps and ancient ruins. IMHA is a passion project made with custom engine by a one-man team. This horror-themed FPS features dynamic pacing and spawn system providing unique challenges every time you play.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Fight through endless hordes of deadly enemies.<br></li><li>Survive an apocalyptic invasion of relentless monsters.<br></li><li>Overcome challenging boss encounters.<br></li><li>Experience a dynamic ever-changing world.</li></ul>",
